sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Owner as SME Owner
    participant Web as GeM Saathi Web App
    participant Session as Saved Session
    participant Calc as Calculation Engine
    participant Bench as Benchmark Registry
    participant Report as Report Service
    participant Delivery as Email or WhatsApp Provider

    Owner->>Web: Open a financial tool directly or after Eligibility
    Web->>Session: Request reusable answers and prior results
    Session-->>Web: Category, city, turnover and eligibility context

    alt Revenue inputs are incomplete
        Web-->>Owner: Ask for category, city and optional turnover
        Owner->>Web: Submit revenue inputs
    else Revenue inputs already exist
        Web-->>Owner: Confirm pre-filled inputs
    end

    Web->>Calc: Request revenue estimate with session context
    Calc->>Bench: Load active category and regional benchmark version
    Bench-->>Calc: Order values, buyers, frequency, sources and vintage
    Calc->>Calc: Produce conservative annual revenue range
    Calc-->>Web: Estimate, caveat and source references
    Web->>Session: Save versioned revenue result
    Web-->>Owner: Show range rather than a single promise

    opt Owner uses Pricing and Margin Calculator
        Owner->>Web: Enter input costs, overheads and desired margin
        Web->>Calc: Request viable and benchmarked pricing
        Calc->>Bench: Load comparable public rate data and survey margin benchmark
        Bench-->>Calc: Dated rates, quality notes and 17.5 percent median benchmark
        Calc->>Calc: Calculate cost floor, target price and achievable margin
        Calc-->>Web: Pricing range and plain-language L1 explanation
        Web->>Session: Save versioned pricing result
        Web-->>Owner: Show margin sensitivity and assumptions
    end

    Owner->>Web: Calculate ROI and effort
    Web->>Session: Load eligibility, revenue and pricing outputs
    Session-->>Web: Combined calculation inputs
    Web->>Calc: Request payback and projections
    Calc->>Bench: Load registration cost, time-to-order and fee assumptions
    Bench-->>Calc: Validated ranges with sources and dates
    Calc->>Calc: Apply active fee and calculate net 1-year and 3-year ranges
    Calc->>Calc: Calculate payback period with uncertainty range
    Calc-->>Web: ROI result, assumptions, sources and calculation version
    Web->>Session: Save combined tool result

    Web->>Report: Compose personalized report from completed tools
    Report->>Session: Read saved inputs and versioned outputs
    Session-->>Report: Eligibility, revenue, pricing, ROI and next actions
    Report-->>Web: Single-page personalized report
    Web-->>Owner: Display report and onboarding recommendation

    opt Owner consents to receive a copy
        Owner->>Web: Provide phone or email and delivery consent
        Web->>Report: Request delivery using consent record
        Report->>Delivery: Send secure report link or summary
        Delivery-->>Report: Delivery status
        Report-->>Web: Sent or retry guidance
        Web-->>Owner: Confirm delivery without exposing contact details
    end
